<<
/Title (Alongside my professional work, I have spent the past three years volunteering in international organizations focused on social impact. I have participated in numerous European training programmes and networking initiatives, and I currently contribute to the Partnerships Team of Fuori Festival in Spoleto, Italy. These experiences have strengthened my understanding of how lasting collaborations are built across cultures, sectors and institutions.)
/Dest [42 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1404 0 R
/Next 1202 0 R
